          <Pad Id="Kg87RQnnWdyfRlk2XOjyFt" Bounds="85,16,440,52" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="How To Use a Slider">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">25</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="x2y9qnClcjJQI9ImzVTaPl" Bounds="85,85,520,94" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Slider (Float) [Qt]&#xD;&#xA;- Channel: binds the value, the user writes back (IOBox 0.3 = start value)&#xD;&#xA;- Min, Max, Step (0 = stepless; here 0..100 in steps of 10)&#xD;&#xA;- Orientation: horizontal or vertical&#xD;&#xA;- Value: current value; Bang: true for one frame when the user changed it">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="i0wCwP2PLJENGGQLLWbIOp" Bounds="85,838,830,94" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Notes:&#xD;&#xA;- A plain value or an IOBox on Channel is the start value and sets the value from the patch.&#xD;&#xA;- Dragging delivers the value live, the mouse wheel and the arrow keys step it. With a Step the value snaps to multiples of it.&#xD;&#xA;- Min and Max fall back to the Min/Max attributes of the channel, then to 0..1; the user wins when both are set.&#xD;&#xA;- Labels in the renderer come from the Labeled element around each slider.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
          <Pad Id="ioQsNOmbqx0udhld92zcZX" Bounds="918,227,300,46" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Two sliders on one Channel node follow each other in both directions.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
